@baseUrl = http://localhost:7015/api/v1
@authToken = paste-a-token-from-auth.http-here

### Create a payload session: multipart/form-data with many raw <skuId>.json
### files under the "documents" field, plus one "feedbackDoc" (.pptx/.docx).
### Multipart bodies aren't expressible in plain REST Client JSON -- use the
### REST Client's multipart/form-data boundary syntax, or a real HTTP client.
# POST {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions HTTP/1.1
# Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary
#
# ------boundary
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="190375736090.json"
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# < ./190375736090.json
# ------boundary
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="feedbackDoc"; filename="feedback.pptx"
# Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation
#
# < ./feedback.pptx
# ------boundary--

### Poll a session's status/progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### List a session's staged files (match status/warnings, no content)
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/files HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### List a session's staged files WITH content (for the "Send to SKU config
### upload" handoff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/files/content HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Download the session's staged files as a zip
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/download HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### List recent payload sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Flat list of every individually-extracted feedback item in a session,
### for the Feedback Verification tab (one card per item: image + text)
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/feedback-items HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Record a human's visual verification of one feedback item's mapping
POST {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/feedback-items/verify HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": "{{skuId}}",
  "itemIndex": 0,
  "status": "correct"
}

### Download a feedback deck (.pptx, one slide per merged item, full-
### resolution images) for a session -- pure visibility/analysis artifact,
### unrelated to RCA or SKU config upload.
GET {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions/{{sessionId}}/feedback-deck HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Clear ALL payload sessions/files -- scoped only to Payload Creation,
### never touches ground-truth documents/versions or RCA batches/traces.
### Irreversible.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/l1-feedback/payload-sessions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
